      "values": {
        "text": {
          "Text": "Tunnel wraps its Texture around the inside of a tube and flies a camera down it. The Ratio Gear at 1 : 4 flies a quarter of a flight a loop, which is how often the Helix path comes back. Turn Twist for a wilder path and Zoom for a wider lens, or cable a noise into Texture."
        }
